al-property/runwal-malabar/343428/project","title":"Runwal Malabar Malabar Hill, Mumbai - Square Yards","content":"— SOURABH, Owner\n\n## RERA Details of Runwal Malabar\n\nRunwal Malabar is registered under MahaRERA with registration number PR1170002502441. The project is currently in the New Launch stage. The possession is expected around Jun 2032. The launch took place around Feb 2026.\n\nBefore booking, buyers should still verify:\n\n Carpet area details\n Sea-facing unit positioning\n Payment schedules\n Tower approvals\n\nRunwal Malabar is registered under MahaRERA with registration number PR1170002502441. The project is currently in the New Launch stage. The possession is expected around Jun 2032. The launch took place around Feb 2026.\n\nBefore booking, buyers should still verify:\n\nCarpet area details\n\nSea-facing unit positioning\n\nPayment schedules\n\nTower approvals [...] Runwal Malabar is a luxury residential development by Runwal located in Malabar Hill, one of the most established premium residential neighbourhoods in Mumbai. The project has been planned as a low-density high-rise tower with only around 10 residences, which sets it apart from many newer luxury developments, where inventory is much higher.\n\nThe residences come in large-format 3, 5 BHK configurations, with layouts extending from 2400 Sq.Ft. to 4900 Sq.Ft.. The homes have private elevator access, full-floor style planning, panoramic sea views, and oversized deck areas connected to the living spaces. The project is currently in the New Launch stage, and the possession is expected around Jun 2032. [...] Squareyards Logo\nRunwal developer logo\n\n# Runwal Malabar Malabar Hill, Mumbai\n\nRunwal Malabar is a luxury residential development by Runwal located in Malabar Hill, one of the most established premium residential neighbourhoods in Mumbai. The project has been planned as a low-density high-rise tower with only around 10 residences, which sets it apart from many newer luxury developments, where inventory is much higher.\n\nThe residences come in large-format 3, 5 BHK configurations, with layouts extending from 2400 Sq.Ft. to 4900 Sq.Ft.. The homes have private elevator access, full-floor style planning, panoramic sea views, and oversized deck areas connected to the living spaces. The project is currently in the New Launch stage, and the possession is expected around Jun 2032.","score":0.8380581,"raw_content":null,"id":"07e33e-04"},{"url":"https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/project/runwal-malabar-walkeshwar/31906","title":"Runwal Malabar, Malabar Hill — Price, Possession & RERA | MPE","content":"10 units, possession Jun 2032. Resale ₹73,272/sqft. This project is quoted around ₹110,000/sqft — 50% above resale here. Duplex of 5000 sqft at ₹55 Cr. ₹14,382","score":0.77548623,"raw_content":null,"id":"1da1ec-05"}],"response_time":2.41,"request_id":"9cf19f22-575a-436e-b38c-1efacc4d982e"}